<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" agent="hiten" version="24.7.5"><diagram id="amu_fsm" name="AMU FSM"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1930" pageHeight="1636" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="title" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:20px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;AMU parcel-run FSM&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="900" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="subtitle" value="One box per State in the Src/main.c switch. UML state-machine notation: trigger [guard] / effect. Terms follow GLOSSARY.md. A / B is the Layout learned by IDENTIFY." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="52" width="1700" height="18" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="start" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="132" y="264" width="16" height="16" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="idle" value="IDLE" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;startSize=26;horizontal=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;collapsible=0;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="300" width="230" height="136" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="idle_body" value="&lt;b&gt;do /&lt;/b&gt; Kobuki_Drive(STOP)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;exit /&lt;/b&gt; layout = none&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;object.detected = 0&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;heading = 0&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;corridor = 0&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Scan_Start(kobuki.angle)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Courier New;overflow=hidden;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="idle"><mxGeometry x="0" y="26" width="230" height="110" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="search_phase" value="SEARCH (phase)" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;startSize=28;horizontal=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;collapsible=0;fontSize=14;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#eeeeee;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=1.5;swimlaneFillColor=#f7f7f7;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="96" width="1060" height="320" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="identify" value="IDENTIFY" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;startSize=26;horizontal=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;collapsible=0;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="search_phase"><mxGeometry x="680" y="213" width="340" height="81" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="identify_body" value="&lt;b&gt;entry /&lt;/b&gt; Kobuki_Drive(STOP)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6b6b6b&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;// then layout =&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6b6b6b&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;//   Layout_From_Range(object.range_mm)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Courier New;overflow=hidden;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="identify"><mxGeometry x="0" y="26" width="340" height="55" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="search" value="SEARCH" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;startSize=26;horizontal=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;collapsible=0;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="search_phase"><mxGeometry x="40" y="213" width="250" height="81" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="search_body" value="&lt;b&gt;do /&lt;/b&gt; scan_sample()&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Kobuki_Rotate(+100)  &lt;font color=&quot;#6b6b6b&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;// ACW&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6b6b6b&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;// until something is near&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Courier New;overflow=hidden;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="search"><mxGeometry x="0" y="26" width="250" height="55" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="search_phase_note" value="&lt;b&gt;Search phase&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The AMU turns anticlockwise on the spot from B0 and reads the ultrasonic once per Tick (scan_sample() = Scan_Update_Turn(kobuki.angle) + Ultrasonic_Detect(&amp;object); object.detected = range_mm &lt; 750). &lt;b&gt;scan_deg&lt;/b&gt; is the net turn since B0 in degrees, ACW positive, summed from gyro changes so it does not wrap at 180; it is only used for the give-up.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Give up&lt;/b&gt; (scan_give_up(): LED1 green, then STOP / FAULT): SEARCH when scan_deg &gt;= 360.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Identify&lt;/b&gt;: on the first Detection the AMU stops, then layout = Layout_From_Range(object.range_mm), which is B when range_mm &lt; 575, otherwise A. LED1 red for A, yellow for B. There is no centring: ORIENT turns from wherever SEARCH stopped." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#444444;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="search_phase"><mxGeometry x="20" y="44" width="1020" height="160" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="orient" value="ORIENT" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;startSize=26;horizontal=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;collapsible=0;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1600" y="294" width="320" height="111" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="orient_body" value="&lt;b&gt;entry /&lt;/b&gt; Kobuki_Rotate_Angle_Setpoint(&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;kobuki.angle, A: -90, B: +90)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=&quot;#6b6b6b&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;// A: CW, B: ACW  (from where&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=&quot;#6b6b6b&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;//   SEARCH stopped)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;do /&lt;/b&gt; Kobuki_Rotate_Angle(kobuki.angle)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Courier New;overflow=hidden;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="orient"><mxGeometry x="0" y="26" width="320" height="85" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="fault" value="STOP / FAULT" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;startSize=26;horizontal=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;collapsible=0;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.5;swimlaneFillColor=#f8cecc;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="510" width="1180" height="53" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="fault_body" value="&lt;b&gt;entry /&lt;/b&gt; Kobuki_Drive(STOP)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Courier New;overflow=hidden;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="fault"><mxGeometry y="26" width="1180" height="27" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="storage" value="STORAGE" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;startSize=28;horizontal=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;collapsible=0;fontSize=14;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#eeeeee;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=1.5;swimlaneFillColor=#f7f7f7;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="670" width="480" height="590" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="pathfind" value="PATHFIND" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;startSize=28;horizontal=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;collapsible=0;fontSize=14;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#eeeeee;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=1.5;swimlaneFillColor=#f7f7f7;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="610" y="670" width="1280" height="590" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="deposit" value="DEPOSIT  (stub)" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;startSize=26;horizontal=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;collapsible=0;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 3;" vertex="1" parent="storage"><mxGeometry x="40" y="50" width="400" height="80" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="deposit_body" value="&lt;b&gt;entry /&lt;/b&gt; Kobuki_Drive(STOP)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6b6b6b&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;// stub: deposit-location sensing&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6b6b6b&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;//&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;is not built yet&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Courier New;overflow=hidden;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="deposit"><mxGeometry y="26" width="400" height="54" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="drive_in" value="DRIVE_IN" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;startSize=26;horizontal=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;collapsible=0;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="storage"><mxGeometry x="40" y="230" width="400" height="94" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="drive_in_body" value="&lt;b&gt;entry /&lt;/b&gt; Kobuki_Drive_Distance_Setpoint(&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;kobuki.distance, 1000)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=&quot;#6b6b6b&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;// through the Entrance&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;do /&lt;/b&gt; Kobuki_Drive_Distance(kobuki.distance)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Courier New;overflow=hidden;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="drive_in"><mxGeometry y="26" width="400" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="turn" value="TURN" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;startSize=26;horizontal=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;collapsible=0;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="storage"><mxGeometry x="40" y="410" width="400" height="94" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="turn_body" value="&lt;b&gt;entry /&lt;/b&gt; Kobuki_Rotate_Angle_Setpoint(&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;kobuki.angle, A: +135, B: -135)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=&quot;#6b6b6b&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;// A: ACW, B: CW&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;(face the Entrance)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;do /&lt;/b&gt; Kobuki_Rotate_Angle(kobuki.angle)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Courier New;overflow=hidden;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="turn"><mxGeometry y="26" width="400" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="storage_note" value="Bumper and cliff are ignored in TURN (the turn is made beside the ledge). DRIVE_IN ignores the cliff; any bumper ends it in DEPOSIT." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#444444;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="storage"><mxGeometry x="20" y="522" width="440" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="p_drive" value="DRIVE" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;startSize=26;horizontal=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;collapsible=0;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="pathfind"><mxGeometry x="780" y="60" width="340" height="67" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="p_drive_body" value="&lt;b&gt;do /&lt;/b&gt; Kobuki_Drive(100)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=&quot;#6b6b6b&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;// below the speed limit of 150&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Courier New;overflow=hidden;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="p_drive"><mxGeometry y="26" width="340" height="41" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="p_reverse" value="REVERSE" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;startSize=26;horizontal=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;collapsible=0;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="pathfind"><mxGeometry x="780" y="260" width="340" height="94" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="p_reverse_body" value="&lt;b&gt;entry /&lt;/b&gt; Kobuki_Drive_Distance_Setpoint(&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;kobuki.distance, -50)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;do /&lt;/b&gt; Kobuki_Drive_Distance(kobuki.distance)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6b6b6b&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;// bumper and cliff are ignored here&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Courier New;overflow=hidden;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="p_reverse"><mxGeometry y="26" width="340" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="p_rotate" value="ROTATE" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;startSize=26;horizontal=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;collapsible=0;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="pathfind"><mxGeometry x="780" y="450" width="340" height="122" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="p_rotate_body" value="&lt;b&gt;entry /&lt;/b&gt; Kobuki_Rotate_Angle_Setpoint(&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;kobuki.angle, pathfind_recover_deg)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=&quot;#6b6b6b&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;// latched in DRIVE: wall A -5, B +5;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=&quot;#6b6b6b&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;//   ledge A +5, B -5; ignores heading&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;do /&lt;/b&gt; Kobuki_Rotate_Angle(kobuki.angle)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6b6b6b&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;// bumper and cliff are ignored here&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Courier New;overflow=hidden;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="p_rotate"><mxGeometry y="26" width="340" height="96" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="p_cturn" value="CORRIDOR_TURN" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;startSize=26;horizontal=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;collapsible=0;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="pathfind"><mxGeometry x="290" y="250" width="340" height="108" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="p_cturn_body" value="&lt;b&gt;entry /&lt;/b&gt; Kobuki_Rotate_Angle_Setpoint(&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;kobuki.angle, A: +90, B: -100)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=&quot;#6b6b6b&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;// A: ACW, B: CW&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;do /&lt;/b&gt; Kobuki_Rotate_Angle(kobuki.angle)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;exit /&lt;/b&gt; heading = kobuki.angle" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Courier New;overflow=hidden;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="p_cturn"><mxGeometry y="26" width="340" height="82" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="p_cstop" value="CORRIDOR_STOP" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;startSize=26;horizontal=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;collapsible=0;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="pathfind"><mxGeometry x="30" y="435" width="210" height="53" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="p_cstop_body" value="&lt;b&gt;entry /&lt;/b&gt; Kobuki_Drive(STOP)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Courier New;overflow=hidden;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="p_cstop"><mxGeometry y="26" width="210" height="27" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="p_choice" value="" style="rhombus;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1150" y="736" width="28" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="pathfind_note" value="One sub-FSM, run twice: corridor = 1 (ends in CORRIDOR_TURN), then corridor = 2 (ends in CORRIDOR_STOP). A corridor ends on the front cliff, not on distance. DRIVE checks, in order: 1 front cliff, 2 storage-wall bumper, 3 ledge cliff. Ignored in DRIVE: ledge-side bumper, storage-wall-side cliff, centre bumper. A wall bumper and a ledge cliff both run REVERSE, then ROTATE, then DRIVE (no forward resume)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#444444;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="pathfind"><mxGeometry x="30" y="505" width="740" height="75" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e_turn_drivein" value="kobuki.rotation_complete" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=0.5000;exitY=0.0000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5000;entryY=1.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="turn" target="drive_in"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="75.0" y="0.0" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_drivein_deposit_bump" value="1: any kobuki.bumper bit&lt;br&gt;/ Kobuki_Drive(STOP)" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=0.1250;exitY=0.0000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.1250;entryY=1.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="drive_in" target="deposit"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="80.0" y="0.0" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_drivein_deposit_done" value="2: kobuki.&lt;br&gt;distance_complete" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=0.8500;exitY=0.0000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.8500;entryY=1.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="drive_in" target="deposit"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="-58.0" y="0.0" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p_drive_reverse" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;2: storage wall bumper&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;[A: kobuki.bumper &amp; 0x04, B: kobuki.bumper &amp; 0x01]&lt;br&gt;3: ledge cliff&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;[A: kobuki.cliff &amp; 0x01, B: kobuki.cliff &amp; 0x04]&lt;/div&gt;" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=0.8529;exitY=1.0000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.8529;entryY=0.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p_drive" target="p_reverse"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="-160.0" y="0.0" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p_reverse_rotate" value="kobuki.distance_complete" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=0.5000;exitY=1.0000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5000;entryY=0.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p_reverse" target="p_rotate"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="78.0" y="0.0" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p_rotate_drive" value="kobuki.&lt;br&gt;rotation_&lt;br&gt;complete" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=1.0000;exitY=0.2459;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=1.0000;entryY=0.2985;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p_rotate" target="p_drive"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1770" y="1150" /><mxPoint x="1770" y="750" /></Array><mxPoint x="45.0" y="5.0" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p_drive_choice" value="1: front cliff&lt;br&gt;[centre cliff sensor]" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=0.0000;exitY=0.2985;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=1.0000;entryY=0.5000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p_drive" target="p_choice"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0.0" y="-32.0" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p_choice_turn" value="[corridor == 1]" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=0.5000;exitY=1.0000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.7765;entryY=0.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p_choice" target="p_cturn"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="-52.0" y="0.0" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p_choice_stop" value="[corridor == 2]" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=0.0000;exitY=0.5000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5000;entryY=0.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p_choice" target="p_cstop"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="745" y="750" /></Array><mxPoint x="177.5" y="-12.0" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p_turn_drive" value="kobuki.rotation_complete&lt;br&gt;/ corridor = 2" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=1.0000;exitY=0.3889;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.0000;entryY=0.7463;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p_cturn" target="p_drive"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1350" y="962" /><mxPoint x="1350" y="780" /></Array><mxPoint x="-82.0" y="-31.0" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p_stop_turn" value="ε" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=0.0000;exitY=0.3774;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=1.0000;entryY=0.4787;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p_cstop" target="turn"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0.0" y="-14.0" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_start" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=0.5000;exitY=1.0000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.4348;entryY=0.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="start" target="idle"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_idle_search" value="B0&lt;br&gt;[button &amp;amp; 0x01]" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=1.0000;exitY=0.3640;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.0000;entryY=0.5000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="idle" target="search"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="-26" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_search_identify" value="[object.detected]" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=1.0000;exitY=0.5000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.0000;entryY=0.5000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="search" target="identify"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="-24" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_identify_orient" value="ε&lt;br&gt;/ layout = A | B&lt;br&gt;LED1 red | yellow" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=1.0000;exitY=0.5000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.0000;entryY=0.5000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="identify" target="orient"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="-30" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_orient_drive" value="kobuki.rotation_complete&lt;br&gt;/ heading = kobuki.angle, corridor = 1" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=0.1875;exitY=1.0000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.7941;entryY=0.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="orient" target="p_drive"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="150" y="0" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="f_search_phase" value="B1 | wheeldrop&lt;br&gt;| bumper | cliff" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.25;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#b85450;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=0.2075;exitY=1.0000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.1864;entryY=0.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="search_phase" target="fault"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="-62" y="0" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="f_search_giveup" value="give up&lt;br&gt;/ LED1 green" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.25;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#b85450;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=0.3962;exitY=1.0000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.3559;entryY=0.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="search_phase" target="fault"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="52" y="0" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="f_orient" value="B1 | wheeldrop&lt;br&gt;| bumper | cliff" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.25;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#b85450;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=0.0000;exitY=0.8739;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.9831;entryY=0.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="orient" target="fault"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1540" y="391" /></Array><mxPoint x="58" y="30" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_fault_idle" value="ε" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=0.0000;exitY=0.5283;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.8391;entryY=1.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="fault" target="idle"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="233" y="538" /></Array><mxPoint x="45" y="-13" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_deposit_idle" value="ε&lt;br&gt;(stub: at once)" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=0.0500;exitY=0.0000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.2609;entryY=1.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="deposit" target="idle"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="48" y="-24" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="f_pathfind" value="B1 | wheeldrop" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.25;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#b85450;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=0.6172;exitY=0.0000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.8644;entryY=1.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="pathfind" target="fault"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="55" y="-1.5" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="f_storage" value="B1 | wheeldrop" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.25;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#b85450;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=0.9167;exitY=0.0000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.0848;entryY=1.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="storage" target="fault"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="-55" y="-1.5" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_dot" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="44" y="1306" width="16" height="16" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_dot_t" value="start (initial State)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#333333;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="1306" width="150" height="18" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_dia" value="" style="rhombus;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="230" y="1300" width="28" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_dia_t" value="choice: one trigger, the guard on each edge picks the way" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#333333;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="266" y="1306" width="340" height="18" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_st" value="state" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="1300" width="90" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_fa" value="fault" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="1300" width="90" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_su" value="composite (sub-FSM)" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#eeeeee;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="860" y="1300" width="170" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_stub" value="stub" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1050" y="1300" width="90" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_red" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#b85450&quot;&gt;red edge&lt;/font&gt; = fault: the State leaves for STOP / FAULT" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#333333;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1170" y="1306" width="600" height="18" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note1" value="&lt;b&gt;How to read it&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A State is a rounded box: its name, then its actions. &lt;b&gt;entry /&lt;/b&gt; runs once on entering, &lt;b&gt;do /&lt;/b&gt; on every Tick in which no edge fired, &lt;b&gt;exit /&lt;/b&gt; once on leaving. Edges read: trigger [guard] / effect. A State's edges are checked in priority order and the first true one fires; a transition runs exit(), then the effect, then entry() of the next State.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;ε&lt;/b&gt; = no trigger: the edge is taken on the next Tick. One Tick = one Kobuki packet: Kobuki_Read() runs first, then the state switch.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Angles are degrees: + = ACW (left), - = CW (right) (Kobuki_Rotate: +ve is CCW). &lt;b&gt;heading&lt;/b&gt; = kobuki.angle, latched at the start of each corridor.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Setpoints (Kobuki_Rotate_Angle_Setpoint, Kobuki_Drive_Distance_Setpoint) are one-shot entry actions. kobuki.rotation_complete and kobuki.distance_complete are copied at the top of the Tick, so a State sees them one Tick after its last do / call." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#333333;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1356" width="570" height="250" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note2" value="&lt;b&gt;Layouts&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A / B is the Layout saved by IDENTIFY, never a live reading. Layout A: bollards A1/A2 block the left/top route, so the AMU takes the bottom corridor, then the right corridor; the storage wall is on its left and the ledge on its right. Layout B is the mirror image: bollards B1/B2 block the bottom/right route.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sensors&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Bumper / cliff bits: right = 0x01, centre = 0x02, left = 0x04. B0 = kobuki.button &amp; 0x01 (start). B1 = kobuki.button &amp; 0x02 (stop). wheeldrop = kobuki.wheeldrop != 0.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Faults&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The sensor fault edge is the first edge of its State, so it wins. B1 | wheeldrop leaves every State except IDLE. The SEARCH phase States and ORIENT also fault on any bumper or cliff. Bumpers and cliffs are expected in PATHFIND and STORAGE, so those regions have one red edge each, for B1 | wheeldrop only. The only timeout is the SEARCH give-up: it faults with LED1 green when it finds nothing." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#333333;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="1356" width="570" height="250" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note3" value="&lt;b&gt;Constants (Src/Helper/helper.h)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;path speed 100, reverse 50 mm, wall-hit nudge A -5 / B +5 (ledge cliff: the opposite), corner A +90 / B -100, Orient A -90 / B +90, storage turn A +135 / B -135, drive-in 1000 mm. Scan: turn speed 100, give-up after a full turn of 360. Layout split 575 mm (B below, A otherwise). Detect range 750 mm (Src/Ultrasonic/ultrasonic.h).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Helpers (Src/Helper/helper.c)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Layout_From_Range(range_mm) is the single split. Scan_Start() zeroes the scan; Scan_Update_Turn() adds the gyro change to scan_deg. scan_sample() and scan_give_up() are in Src/main.c.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;IDLE reset&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;IDLE clears the layout, object, heading, corridor and scan variables when B0 starts a run.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Calibration (layout split, detect range)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The split is a calibration value (575 mm now). IDENTIFY reads the first in-range reading, taken as the sonar beam first reaches the bollard, so calibrate the same way: turn the AMU anticlockwise onto B1, then onto A1, and read robot.object.range_mm when SEARCH stops; the split goes between them. The detect range must stay above the A1 reading and below the nearest wall." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#333333;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1240" y="1356" width="570" height="250" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>